      "id": "white-king-breaks-the-blockade",
      "side": "white",
      "label": "The king breaks the blockade",
      "description": "The bishop cannot evict a blockader on the other colour — only the king can. Walk it in on the squares the defending bishop does not control and escort the pawn square by square.",
