      "side": "black",
      "label": "Blockade on your bishop's colour",
      "description": "Stop the passer on a square your bishop defends, with the king covering the squares of the other colour; a correct blockade holds by geometry no matter how large the material deficit reads.",
      "success": {"note":"A fortress is an outcome, not a census; no structural signature is honest here.","signature":null}
    },
