      "id": "black-bishop-for-the-last-pawn",
      "side": "black",
      "label": "Sell the bishop for the last dangerous pawn",
      "description": "The bishop's final job is to give itself for the pawn that would break the fortress, when the remaining position is a counted draw; price that liquidation before the fortress cracks, not after.",
